{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "2CO",
  "chapter": 10,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now I Paul myself beseech you, by the meekness and gentleness of Christ, who in presence ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " base among you, but being absent am bold towards you:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I beseech ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "you",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that I may not be bold when I am present with that confidence, with which I think to be bold against some, who think of us as if we walked according to the flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For though we walk in the flesh, we do not war according to the flesh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "(For the weapons of our warfare ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not carnal, but mighty through God to the pulling down of strong holds;)",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Casting down imaginations, and every high thing that exalteth itself against the knowledge of God, and bringing into captivity every thought to the obedience of Christ;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And having in a readiness to avenge all disobedience, when your obedience is fulfilled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do ye look on things after the outward appearance? If any man trusteth to himself that he is Christ's, let him of himself think this again, that, as he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Christ's, even so ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " we Christ's.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For though I should boast somewhat more of our authority, which the Lord hath given us for edification, and not for your destruction, I should not be ashamed:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That I may not seem as if I would terrify you by letters.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " letters (say they) ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " weighty and powerful; but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bodily presence ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " weak, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " speech contemptible.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let such one think this, that such as we are in word by letters when we are absent, such ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "will we be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also in deed when we are present.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For we dare not make ourselves of the number, or compare ourselves with some that commend themselves: but they measuring themselves by themselves, and comparing themselves among themselves, are not wise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But we will not boast of things without ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " measure, but according to the measure of the rule which God hath distributed to us, a measure to reach even to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For we stretch not ourselves beyond ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our measure",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", as though we reached not to you; for we are come as far as to you also in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "preaching",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the gospel of Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Not boasting of things without ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " measure, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", of other men's labors; but having hope, when your faith is increased, that we shall be enlarged by you, according to our rule abundantly,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To preach the gospel in the ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "regions",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " beyond you, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not to boast in another man's line of things made ready to our hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he that glorieth, let him glory in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2CO.10.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:2CO.10.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For not he that commendeth himself is approved, but whom the Lord commendeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
